sequenceDiagram
  actor Applicant as Fresher
  actor School as School Admin
  actor Dept as Department Admin
  participant App as Dues system
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Applicant->>App: Submit pre-registration
  App->>DB: Insert application (pending)
  School->>App: Verify and register fresher
  App->>DB: Insert student, assign department
  School->>App: Record school dues and souvenirs
  App->>DB: Insert SCH receipt and payment lines
  Dept->>App: Admit fresher at level 100-400
  Dept->>App: Record department dues
  App->>DB: Insert DEPT receipt and payment lines
